  "result": "Excellent! All tests pass. Here's what I've added:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Added `vatSummary(invoices)` function to `src/reports.js`** that:\n- Filters invoices with status `'issued'`, `'partially_paid'`, or `'paid'`\n- For each line, calculates:\n  - `base` = lineTotal - lineDiscount (the amount VAT is calculated on)\n  - `vat` = lineVAT (VAT amount at that rate)\n- Groups by VAT rate and sums base and vat amounts\n- Returns array: `[{ rate, base, vat }]` sorted by rate descending (high to low)\n\n**Added 23 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Empty/no-eligible invoices\n- Status filtering (issued/partially_paid/paid vs. draft)\n- Base and VAT calculations\n- Multiple VAT rates (21%, 9%, 0%)\n- Aggregation across lines and invoices\n- Mixed invoice statuses\n- Discounted lines\n- VAT-exempt products\n- Sorting by rate high-to-low\n- Immutability\n- Large datasets\n- Customer tier discounts\n- Multiple customers\n- Line-by-line verification\n\nAll **275 tests passing** (252 existing + 23 new for vatSummary).",
